  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">reform f&#xf6;r UN Delivering as One</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">reforms re: UN Delivering as One - Support One-UN reform</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">FN-organen i Zambia har p&#xe5;b&#xf6;rjat reformen &quot;Delivering as One&quot; vilket  v&#xe4;ntas resultera i mer fokuserade aktiviteter, effektivare            programmering och b&#xe4;ttre resursanv&#xe4;ndande d&#xe5; dubbelarbete och         transaktionskostnader kan minskas.  B&#xe4;ttre resursanv&#xe4;ndande &#xe4;r h&#xf6;gst  relevant i den Zambiska kontexten d&#xe4;r bist&#xe5;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Delivering as One (DaO) initiative builds on the existing reform  agenda which aims to accelerate efforts and increase coherence and    effectiveness of UN operations in the field. The expected gains of    minimising duplication and transaction in terms of more value for     money is  of specific relevance to Zambia as ODA is expected to       decrease as Zambia progresses to middle income country.</narrative>
  </description>
